To depict a species (text) at an x (number) by a y (number):
  If the species is "Bulbasaur":
    Drawbulbasaur at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Charmander":
    Drawcharmander at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Squirtle":
    Drawsquirtle at the x by the y.


